==English==

===Etymology===
From the act of [[tying]] or even [[nail]]ing a pigeon to a stool to act as a [[decoy]] for hunters.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} A decoy or an [[informer]], especially one who is a [[spy]] for the police.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|stoolie}}/[[stooly]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:informant]]

